 Countersign already ties each payment to an ERC-8004 `agentWallet`. This bridge optionally asks Agentkey “is this agent still who they claim?” **before** the gateway accepts a payment.
 
+## Integrated ≠ enabled
+
+The bridge package and gateway choke points are always **integrated** in this codebase. That does **not** mean the identity gate is on.
+
+| Signal | Meaning |
+| --- | --- |
+| `GET /health` → `agentkey.integrated: true` | Bridge code is wired into this build |
+| `GET /health` → `agentkey.enabled: false` | **No** Agentkey call; demos work as before (default) |
+| `GET /health` → `agentkey.enabled: true` | Gate is live: fail-closed verify before pay |
+
+Production must set `AGENTKEY_VERIFY_ENABLED=true` (and bindings). Startup logs a warning when the gate is disabled.
+
 ## What is wired
 
-- Package `@countersign/agentkey-bridge` — maps ERC-8004 agent id ↔ Agentkey id, calls `@agentkey/sdk` `verify`
+- Package `@countersign/agentkey-bridge` — bindings, payment-bound challenges, `@agentkey/sdk` `verify`
 - Gateway choke point: `POST /v1/payments` and `POST /v1/runs` (MCP / SDK pay tools go through the gateway)
 - Behind env flags (default **off** so existing testnet demos keep working)
 
 Verify is **fail closed**: only Agentkey `status: "valid"` authorizes. Transport errors, `invalid`, `unknown`, `revoked`, and `error` all return **403** — never soft-allow.
 
+## Bindings are authoritative
+
+`AGENTKEY_BINDINGS` maps ERC-8004 agent id → Agentkey id. When a binding exists for the recovered ERC-8004 agent:
+
+- That Agentkey id is used for verify.
+- Client `agentkey.id` that **differs** → **403** (mismatch).
+- Matching explicit id is allowed but redundant.
+
+Client `agentkey.id` is only used when there is **no** binding for that ERC-8004 agent.
+
+## Payment-bound challenge format
+
+Static challenges (e.g. `countersign-pay`) are **rejected** when the gate is on. The proof’s `challenge` must bind to this payment and carry a short TTL:
+
+```
+countersign-pay-v1:{vault}:{invoiceHash}:{amount}:{payTo}:{deadline}:{nonce}:{exp}
+```
+
+| Field | Meaning |
+| --- | --- |
+| `vault` | Order vault address (`0x…`, lowercase) |
+| `invoiceHash` | Payment `invoiceHash` (`0x…` bytes32) |
+| `amount` | Payment amount decimal string (same as body) |
+| `payTo` | Payee address (`0x…`) |
+| `deadline` | Payment deadline unix seconds |
+| `nonce` | Client hex (≥16 chars, no `0x`); unique per proof |
+| `exp` | Unix seconds; gateway rejects if `now > exp` or `exp > now + 900` (15 min max TTL) |
+
+Helper: `buildPaymentChallenge` / `assertPaymentBoundChallenge` from `@countersign/agentkey-bridge`.
+
+Replaying an old proof on a **different** invoice fails field match. Replaying after `exp` fails TTL.
+
